        carry ZERO world_law_magic findings of any kind at this slot, because no
        Magic-shelf row reaches a magic-free roster until MF-CH2B's P5 lands, so the cure
        has nothing to remove yet. It is the guard that lets P5 land without the
        certification turning on the rows it admits.
      - the golden master, CODE TO CODE against a clean export of this base: 0 of 525.
        (The committed manifest is 525 of 525 red at this base, before and after this car
